+## OQ-copy-email-retention
+**Is the email address for the copy kept after the copy is sent, and is it recorded for HR? Or is it used only to send the copy?**
+
+No receiving party needs this address. Keeping it would hold personal data that no party needs (data minimisation, G-01).
+
+Options:
+- Use it only to send the copy and do not keep it
+- Record it for HR with the other answers
+
+**Recommendation:** Use it only to send the copy; HR confirms.
+
